    "text": "Geez, the kid, Campbell just turned 22. He obviously has talent and I believe that Vrabel will tap into that. He's an enormous young man. Maybe move him to center? Signed a 35-year Bills fan. Also, I can't believe how the media is ripping Drake Maye. Have they learned anything about doing that when Sam Darnold was with four other football teams? Oh yeah, the last 2 years Sam goes 28 and 6, throws for 8,400 yards and 60 touchdowns- number one in the entire NFL, and now has a Super Bowl ring!",
